# Postman's git integration writes a second, exploded copy of the collection here.
# The single source of truth is bankapi/postman/*.json - that is what newman and CI run.
# Two representations of the same collection drift; the tree wins in the GUI while the
# json goes stale, and newman then tests requests nobody is using.
/postman/
